<section id="report" class="light sec" style="padding-top: 140px; padding-bottom: 140px">
<div class="wrap report-grid">
<div>
<h2 data-split="1" class="disp" style="margin: 0 0 20px; font-size: 52px; line-height: 56px">What lands in your inbox each month</h2>
<p data-fade="1" style="margin: 0 0 20px; font-size: 18px; line-height: 29px; color: oklch(47.1% 0.028 220.2); max-width: 40ch">One page. Written by the engineer who did the work, for someone who has better things to do than read about IT.</p>
<p data-fade="1" style="margin: 0; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; color: oklch(47.1% 0.028 220.2)">This is a sample. Your figures will be your own.</p>
</div>
<article class="report" data-fade="1" aria-label="Sample monthly report">
<div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; gap: 16px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-bottom: 28px">
<span class="disp" style="font-size: 26px; line-height: 30px; font-weight: 600">October 2026</span>
<span class="mono" style="color: oklch(47.1% 0.028 220.2)">Sample client, 18 staff</span>
</div>
<dl>
<dt>Support</dt><dd>23 requests in, 23 closed. Median first reply 41 minutes.</dd>
<dt>Backups</dt><dd>3 of 3 test restores passed. The longest took 14 minutes.</dd>
<dt>Licences</dt><dd>4 unused Microsoft 365 licences removed. That saves $88 a month.</dd>
<dt>Security</dt><dd><span class="anno-row" style="display: inline-block">2 staff still sign in without multi-factor. Sorted by Friday.<svg class="anno-ring" viewBox="0 0 100 40" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"><path data-anno="1" pathLength="1" d="M6 22 C 6 6, 40 3, 70 4 C 92 5, 98 14, 95 25 C 92 36, 55 38, 28 36 C 10 35, 2 30, 5 19 C 7 12, 14 9, 22 8" style="fill: none; stroke: oklch(51.7% 0.110 70.5); stroke-width: 1.6; stroke-linecap: round; vector-effect: non-scaling-stroke; stroke-dasharray: 1; stroke-dashoffset: 0"></path></svg></span><span class="anno-note" data-anno-note="1">We would rather tell you than tidy it away.</span></dd>
<dt>Next month</dt><dd>Replace the reception PC. It is seven years old and nobody wants to sit there.</dd>
</dl>
<p style="margin: 64px 0 0; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; color: oklch(47.1% 0.028 220.2)">Prepared by your named engineer. Questions go straight to them.</p>
</article>
</div>
</section>
